Effect: a same-directory roster label flip (roster-r88.json digest 1e2dcc8b... -> anything else)
and a modified counter copy both read `void: freeze mismatch: <rel>` rc 2 instead of running; the
frozen run is unchanged (counter 7d2073df..., roster 1e2dcc8b... both equal the manifest at
1fac4195). The candidate battery stays outside the check on purpose: it is the object under test,
frozen only by the receipt's battery_sha256.
